{"audio": "revelation-02.opus", "duration_ms": 259096, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2080, "end_ms": 3420, "text": "Revelation, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 4700, "end_ms": 14181, "text": "“To the angel of the church in Ephesus write: These are the words of Him who holds the seven stars in His right hand and walks among the seven golden lampstands."}, {"start_ms": 14981, "end_ms": 17801, "text": "I know your deeds, your labor, and your perseverance."}, {"start_ms": 18321, "end_ms": 25822, "text": "I know that you cannot tolerate those who are evil, and you have tested and exposed as liars those who falsely claim to be apostles."}, {"start_ms": 26802, "end_ms": 31622, "text": "Without growing weary, you have persevered and endured many things for the sake of My name."}, {"start_ms": 32462, "end_ms": 36042, "text": "But I have this against you: You have abandoned your first love."}, {"start_ms": 36582, "end_ms": 39442, "text": "Therefore, keep in mind how far you have fallen."}, {"start_ms": 40342, "end_ms": 42823, "text": "Repent and perform the deeds you did at first."}, {"start_ms": 43503, "end_ms": 48163, "text": "But if you do not repent, I will come to you and remove your lampstand from its place."}, {"start_ms": 49063, "end_ms": 54463, "text": "But you have this to your credit: You hate the works of the Nicolaitans, which I also hate."}, {"start_ms": 55243, "end_ms": 58804, "text": "He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches."}, {"start_ms": 59424, "end_ms": 64444, "text": "To the one who overcomes, I will grant the right to eat from the tree of life in the Paradise of God."}, {"start_ms": 65724, "end_ms": 72404, "text": "To the angel of the church in Smyrna write: These are the words of the First and the Last, who died and returned to life."}, {"start_ms": 73325, "end_ms": 76425, "text": "I know your affliction and your poverty—though you are rich!"}, {"start_ms": 76965, "end_ms": 82945, "text": "And I am aware of the slander of those who falsely claim to be Jews, but are in fact a synagogue of Satan."}, {"start_ms": 83745, "end_ms": 85725, "text": "Do not fear what you are about to suffer."}, {"start_ms": 85725, "end_ms": 92666, "text": "Behold, the devil is about to throw some of you into prison to test you, and you will suffer tribulation for ten days."}, {"start_ms": 93366, "end_ms": 96726, "text": "Be faithful even unto death, and I will give you the crown of life."}, {"start_ms": 97706, "end_ms": 101506, "text": "He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches."}, {"start_ms": 101966, "end_ms": 105226, "text": "The one who overcomes will not be harmed by the second death."}, {"start_ms": 106647, "end_ms": 113167, "text": "To the angel of the church in Pergamum write: These are the words of the One who holds the sharp, double-edged sword."}, {"start_ms": 113987, "end_ms": 119247, "text": "I know where you live, where the throne of Satan sits, yet you hold fast to My name."}, {"start_ms": 119267, "end_ms": 126548, "text": "You did not deny your faith in Me, even in the days of My faithful witness Antipas, who was killed among you where Satan dwells."}, {"start_ms": 127468, "end_ms": 140189, "text": "But I have a few things against you, because some of you hold to the teaching of Balaam, who taught Balak to place a stumbling block before the Israelites so they would eat food sacrificed to idols and commit sexual immorality."}, {"start_ms": 141149, "end_ms": 145229, "text": "In the same way, some of you also hold to the teaching of the Nicolaitans."}, {"start_ms": 145649, "end_ms": 146549, "text": "Therefore repent!"}, {"start_ms": 147209, "end_ms": 151509, "text": "Otherwise I will come to you shortly and wage war against them with the sword of My mouth."}, {"start_ms": 152329, "end_ms": 156110, "text": "He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches."}, {"start_ms": 156750, "end_ms": 159250, "text": "To the one who overcomes, I will give the hidden manna."}, {"start_ms": 159890, "end_ms": 165510, "text": "I will also give him a white stone inscribed with a new name, known only to the one who receives it."}, {"start_ms": 166750, "end_ms": 176311, "text": "To the angel of the church in Thyatira write: These are the words of the Son of God, whose eyes are like a blazing fire and whose feet are like polished bronze."}, {"start_ms": 177111, "end_ms": 184291, "text": "I know your deeds—your love, your faith, your service, your perseverance—and your latest deeds are greater than your first."}, {"start_ms": 185291, "end_ms": 190752, "text": "But I have this against you: You tolerate that woman Jezebel, who calls herself a prophetess."}, {"start_ms": 191492, "end_ms": 197532, "text": "By her teaching she misleads My servants to be sexually immoral and to eat food sacrificed to idols."}, {"start_ms": 198292, "end_ms": 202453, "text": "Even though I have given her time to repent of her immorality, she is unwilling."}, {"start_ms": 203273, "end_ms": 211393, "text": "Behold, I will cast her onto a bed of sickness, and those who commit adultery with her will suffer great tribulation unless they repent of her deeds."}, {"start_ms": 212413, "end_ms": 222234, "text": "Then I will strike her children dead, and all the churches will know that I am the One who searches minds and hearts, and I will repay each of you according to your deeds."}, {"start_ms": 223094, "end_ms": 236855, "text": "But I say to the rest of you in Thyatira, who do not hold to her teaching and have not learned the so-called deep things of Satan: I will place no further burden upon you than to hold fast to what you have until I come."}, {"start_ms": 237515, "end_ms": 243535, "text": "And to the one who overcomes and continues in My work until the end, I will give authority over the nations."}, {"start_ms": 243995, "end_ms": 250575, "text": "He will rule them with an iron scepter and shatter them like pottery—just as I have received authority from My Father."}, {"start_ms": 251296, "end_ms": 253056, "text": "And I will give him the morning star."}, {"start_ms": 254096, "end_ms": 257696, "text": "He who has an ear, let him hear what the Spirit says to the churches."}], "words": [{"t": "Revelation,", "s": 2080, "e": 2620, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2860, "e": 3180, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 3280, "e": 3420, "si": 0}, {"t": "“To", "s": 4700, "e": 4780, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4840, "e": 4920, "si": 1}, {"t": "angel", "s": 5040, "e": 5400, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 5460, "e": 5520, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5560, "e": 5640, "si": 1}, {"t": "church", "s": 5720, "e": 5980, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6040, "e": 6100, "si": 1}, {"t": "Ephesus", "s": 6200, "e": 6680, "si": 1}, {"t": "write:", "s": 6780, "e": 7100, "si": 1}, {"t": "These", "s": 7700, "e": 8060, "si": 1}, {"t": "are", "s": 8101, "e": 8181, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 8181, "e": 8261, "si": 1}, {"t": "words", "s": 8301, "e": 8561, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 8601, "e": 8681, "si": 1}, {"t": "Him", "s": 8741, "e": 8921, "si": 1}, {"t": "who", "s": 9041, "e": 9141, "si": 1}, {"t": "holds", "s": 9241, "e": 9621, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 9681, "e": 9761, "si": 1}, {"t": "seven", "s": 9861, "e": 10141, "si": 1}, {"t": "stars", "s": 10221, "e": 10621, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 10681, "e": 10741, "si": 1}, {"t": "His", "s": 10761, "e": 10901, "si": 1}, {"t": "right", "s": 10981, "e": 11201, "si": 1}, {"t": "hand", "s": 11241, "e": 11581, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 11701, "e": 11801, "si": 1}, {"t": "walks", "s": 11901, "e": 12241, "si": 1}, {"t": "among", "s": 12281, "e": 12521, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 12561, "e": 12641, "si": 1}, {"t": "seven", "s": 12721, "e": 13001, "si": 1}, {"t": "golden", "s": 13101, "e": 13441, "si": 1}, {"t": "lampstands.", "s": 13501, "e": 14181, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 14981, "e": 15001, "si": 2}, {"t": "know", "s": 15021, "e": 15181, "si": 2}, {"t": "your", "s": 15241, "e": 15361, "si": 2}, {"t": "deeds,", "s": 15421, "e":